<title>USA: Memphis-Shelby Cty, Tenn., repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Memphis-Shelby Cty, Tenn., repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced Memphis-Shelby County Airport Authority, Tenn.'s $45.7 million airport refunding bond issue, lowering yields five basis points in the 2007 through 2011 maturities.</p>
<p>MEMPHIS-SHELBY COUNTY AIRPORT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $45,660,000*</p>
<p>AIRPORT REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>FORWARDS</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD BASED ON THE FOLLOWING REPRICING 2007 TO 2011.</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/18/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 02/15/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 02/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>02/15/1999		  430M    5.25  %	  4.95</p>
<p>02/15/2000		  450M    5.25  %	  5.00</p>
<p>02/15/2001		3,220M    5.25  %	  5.05</p>
<p>02/15/2002		3,385M    5.25  %	  5.10</p>
<p>02/15/2003		3,560M    5.50  %	  5.20</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>02/15/2004		3,755M    5.50  %	  5.25</p>
<p>02/15/2005		3,955M    6.00  %	  5.35</p>
<p>02/15/2006		4,175M    6.00  %	  5.40</p>
<p>02/15/2007		4,410M    6.00  %	  5.45</p>
<p>02/15/2008		4,655M    6.00  %	  5.55</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>02/15/2009		4,925M    6.25  %	  5.60</p>
<p>02/15/2010		5,210M    6.25  %	  5.70</p>
<p>02/15/2011		3,530M    6.25  %	  5.75</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, December 5, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 18, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>The Chapman Company</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
